+| Ordinary path | `ExternalMidiDeviceTest::theCommandConfiguresTheDeviceAndThePatchReachesTheOutput` | port/channel/bank/program applied and patch sent | pass, EXIT 0 (`test-7-qt5-externalmidi-functions.log`) |
